+        <span class="ref-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.6 14.5c-2.6-.6-4.4-2.7-4.4-5.2C5.2 6.8 7.4 5 10 5c2.2 0 4 1.4 4.6 3.4"/><path d="M19.4 14.5c-2.6-.6-4.4-2.7-4.4-5.2C15 6.8 17.2 5 19.8 5"/></svg></span>
